<title>POLAND: KABLE SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>KABLE SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER	     1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.60 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.60 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.22 vs   1.51</p>
<p> Sales		   11.84 vs  12.45</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.23 vs   3.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.23 vs   3.39</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.74 vs   3.81</p>
<p> Sales		   98.01 vs  80.56</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Slaska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
